#. Tag: para
#: migrator-applications.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; has many applications, often prefixed with (or containing) the letter "
"k. The names are generally self-explanatory, but it can still be difficult "
"sometimes to find the appropriate packages. Migrates from operating systems "
"such as <trademark class=\"registered\">Microsoft Windows</trademark> or "
"<trademark class=\"registered\">Apple Macintosh</trademark> might have some "
"difficulty in locating an application for a particular job. Below is a table "
"with an expansion on the &kmenu; and the respective Win/Mac equivalent."
msgstr ""

